verse the treacherous path of cultivation and avoid the notice of those who may do him harm. This is a story of an ordinary mortal who, against all odds, clashes with devilish demons and ancient celestials in order to find his own path towards immortality.</p>","updated":1781385952,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/49302"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3646192","name":"Episode 196"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3646193","name":"Episode 197"}}}}},{"id":3784563,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784563/the-lament-of-autumn-1x23-episode-23","name":"Episode 23","season":1,"number":23,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-10-24","airtime":"12:00","airstamp":"2026-10-24T04:00:00+00:00","runtime":null,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784563"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/87946","name":"The Lament of Autumn"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":87946,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/87946/the-lament-of-autumn","name":"The Lament of Autumn","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Romance","War"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":47,"premiered":"2026-10-12","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://www.mgtv.com/h/802659/23704318.html","schedule":{"time":"12:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":77,"network":{"id":276,"name":"Hunan TV","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"webChannel":{"id":226,"name":"Mango TV","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":"https://w.mgtv.com/"},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/645/1613254.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/645/1613254.jpg"},"summary":"<p>In the turbulent 1920s, Yu Changxuan and Ye Pingjun fall into a love-hate entanglement, defying war and fate together.</p>","updated":1792747337,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/87946"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784562","name":"Episode 22"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784563","name":"Episode 23"}}}}},{"id":3784598,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784598/where-the-mask-ends-1x17-episode-17","name":"Episode 17","season":1,"number":17,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-10-24","airtime":"12:00","airstamp":"2026-10-24T04:00:00+00:00","runtime":null,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784598"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/88082","name":"Where the Mask Ends"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":88082,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/88082/where-the-mask-ends","name":"Where the Mask Ends","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Romance"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":52,"premiered":"2026-10-16","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://v.youku.com/v_show/id_XNjU3MzkyOTA0NA==.html","schedule":{"time":"12:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":85,"network":{"id":297,"name":"CCTV-8","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"webChannel":{"id":118,"name":"Youku","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/645/1613260.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/645/1613260.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Chou was once a lowly night-soil collector, bullied and mistreated by everyone around her. But her striking resemblance to Wei Rao, the daughter of a marquis, unexpectedly makes her the bride of Lu Zhuo, the heir to a duke's household, in a marriage arranged to bring him good fortune and save his life. Ambitious and determined to rise above her station, Chou sees the marriage as her chance to climb the social ladder. However, her critically ill husband suddenly awakens, and her assumption of another woman's place brings one disaster after another. Furious that Chou has taken her place, Wei Rao is desperate to get rid of her. Meanwhile, Lu Zhuo regards Chou as a vicious and scheming woman, constantly guarding against her and plotting against her. Beneath the seemingly harmonious facade of the duke's household lie countless traps and deadly schemes. Caught in the midst of these hidden conflicts, Chou struggles to navigate the competing interests around her while carefully planning her future. Determined to break free from the shackles of fate, she eventually uncovers the secrets of her own origins and reunites with her loved ones. Rising from a humble night-soil collector to a woman of status, she transforms her life and creates a brilliant future for herself.</p>","updated":1792747228,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/88082"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784597","name":"Episode 16"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784598","name":"Episode 17"}}}}},{"id":3794811,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3794811/my-loong-1x09-episode-9","name":"Episode 9","season":1,"number":9,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-10-24","airtime":"12:00","airstamp":"2026-10-24T04:00:00+00:00","runtime":16,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3794811"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/94634","name":"My Loong"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":94634,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/94634/my-loong","name":"My Loong","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Fantasy","Romance"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":16,"premiered":"2026-10-22","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/x/cover/mzc00200qo1tv5i.html","schedule":{"time":"12:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":56,"network":null,"webChannel":{"id":104,"name":"Tencent QQ","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/"},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/647/1618078.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/647/1618078.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Yue Wangshu, the daughter of a military family, is offered as a sacrifice to the Dragon Abyss. There, she accidentally releases the Dragon Lord Li Zhi. From hostility to mutual understanding, they form an alliance based on a bargain to suppress the Li Fire. She uses the Dragon Lord's power to fight back against the plots of the Yue family and Prince Qi, while he learns human love through her. Ultimately, Li Zhi chooses to remain in the human world, and the two create an epic romance.</p>","updated":1792699249,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/94634"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3794810","name":"Episode 8"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3794811","name":"Episode 9"}}}}},{"id":3794812,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3794812/my-loong-1x10-episode-10","name":"Episode 10","season":1,"number":10,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-10-24","airtime":"12:00","airstamp":"2026-10-24T04:00:00+00:00","runtime":16,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3794812"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/94634","name":"My Loong"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":94634,"url"